ectric Locomotive","itemType":"Electric Locomotive","varDesc":"Electric Locomotive in orange (1931). Locomotive has cast headlights and disc drive wheels. In lieu of \"254\", the number plates contained \"No. 4 BILD-A-LOCO\". This is a late version of the \"No. 4 BILD-A-LOCO\" that has a slot in the front hood of the locomotive. It is believed that the slot was intended for use with an Ives chassis to accommodate the reverse lever on the Ives motor during the Lionel / Ives Transition Period. A No. 4 Locomotive using an Ives chassis has never been reported. This locomotive was often a component of an uncataloged set offered through Macy's","gauge":"O","yearProd":"1931","_era":"prewar","_tab":"Lionel Pre-War","refLink":"https://cornucopiaoftoytrains.com/prewar-no-254-engines/#24"},{"itemNum":"5","variation":"A","description":"0-4-0 Locomotive, no tender, early (std)","itemType":"Steam Locomotive","varDesc":"NYC & HRR","gauge":"Standard","yearProd":"1906-1907","_era":"prewar","_tab":"Lionel Pre-War"},{"itemNum":"5","variation":"B","description":"0-4-0 Locomotive, no tender, early (std)","itemType":"Steam Locomotive","varDesc":"Pennsylvania","gauge":"Standard","yearProd":"1906-1907","_era":"prewar","_tab":"Lionel Pre-War"},{"itemNum":"5","variation":"C","description":"0-4-0 Locomotive, no tender, early (std)","itemType":"Steam Locomotive","varDesc":"NYC & HRRR (3 Rs)","gauge":"Standard","yearProd":"1906-1907","_era":"prewar","_tab":"Lionel Pre-War"},{"itemNum":"5","variation":"D","description":"0-4-0 Locomotive, no tender, early (std)","itemType":"Steam Locomotive","varDesc":"B&O RR","gauge":"Standard","yearProd":"1906-1907","_era":"prewar","_tab":"Lionel Pre-War"},{"itemNum":"5","description":"0-4-0 Locomotive, tender, early Special (std)","itemType":"Steam Locomotive","gauge":"Standard","yearProd":"1906-1909","_era":"prewar","_tab":"Lionel Pre-War"},{"itemNum":"5","description":"0-4-0 Locomotive, no tender, later (std)","itemType":"Steam Locomotive","gauge":"Standard"